Complete the sentences and say what Mag and her family did yesterday.
Example: Mag didn’t feed the bird;
she fed the cat and the dog.

Work in pairs. Make up a dialogue “In the shop”. Tiny would like to buy clothes:
– for his birthday party;
– for a picnic.

Tell Baby Elephant what clothes he may put on.
– for playing tennis in summer;
– for autumn walks in the forest;
– for playing snowballs in a Russian winter.
Example: You may put on ... .
